{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgQ3EADQvhr5V656y1Gr6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I couldn't find the FY 2024 totals with these tools, so this answer has KPI names but no numbers.\n\n**What I found:** Spirit Airlines filed its FY 2024 10-K on 3 March 2025. It now trades as SAVEQ after going into Chapter 11. A full-text search confirmed that the 10-K's operating statistics include these KPIs:\n\n| Operating KPI (confirmed in the FY 2024 10-K) | FY 2024 Total |\n|---|---|\n| Available seat miles (ASMs) | Not found with these tools |\n| Revenue passenger miles (RPMs) | Not found with these tools |\n| Passenger flight segments | Not found with these tools |\n| Average stage length | Not found with these tools |\n| Average daily aircraft utilization | Not found with these tools |\n| TRASM (total revenue per ASM) | Not found with these tools |\n| CASM (operating cost per ASM) | Not found with these tools |\n\nThe filing also contains the phrase \"load factor.\" It most likely appears in the operating statistics table, but my search didn't confirm that. Spirit's operating statistics tables usually list more items too, such as average yield, fuel gallons consumed, average fuel cost per gallon, aircraft at period end and adjusted CASM. I didn't check for those, so treat them as unconfirmed.\n\n**What was missing:**\n1. **No access by ticker.** The tools that return financial data (company facts, financial concepts) only accept active tickers. \"SAVE,\" \"SAVEQ\" and the CIK (1498710) were all rejected because Spirit is no longer on the active ticker list.\n2. **Search shows matches, not text.** Full-text search can tell me a filing contains a phrase, but it doesn't return the surrounding text. That means I couldn't read the operating statistics table or its FY 2024 values.\n\nTo get the totals, open the \"Operating Statistics\" table in the 10-K's Management's Discussion and Analysis section at the URL below.\n\n**Sources**\n- Spirit Airlines, Inc. Form 10-K for FY 2024, filed 2025-03-03, accession 0001498710-25-000008 (https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1498710/000149871025000008/save-20241231.htm). I only confirmed KPI terms by full-text search; I couldn't read any values."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":711,"cache_read_input_tokens":8191,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":711},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"be57a1e2-e8f0-4edd-bf14-2bcc2af9bbce","uuid":"8cfe9891-5420-447d-8292-1ad48651951e","timestamp":"2026-10-26T02:12:53.902Z","request_id":"req_011CgQ3E9xYN3Mf3KUYfqZg1"}
